    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/19d61ffd-fd90-46c6-abf5-101d996f34fe-01/SelectionCriterion$_PriorInformationNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_SelectionCriteria2>,
